OL,3,ABank of England expected to raise
OL,4,Ainterest rates for first time in more
OL,5,Athan three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank uses interest rates as a tool
OL,8,Fto help slow inflation - currently
OL,9,F3.5%, above the Bank's 2% target - by
OL,10,Fmaking borrowing more expensive
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
