OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer's sentence being
OL,4,Areviewed by Court of Appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FVickrum Digwa stabbed 18-year-old
OL,7,Fstudent Henry Nowak to death in
OL,8,FSouthampton in December 2025
OL,10,FHe was found guilty of murder and
OL,11,Fjailed for life with a minimum term of
OL,12,F21 years
OL,14,FDigwa was given permission to challenge
OL,15,Fthe length of his sentence at the Court
OL,16,Fof Appeal
OL,18,FThe court will also decide on a
OL,19,Freferral by the Attorney General's
OL,20,Foffice, which argued the sentence was
OL,21,Funduly lenient
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
