OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer's sentence being
OL,4,Areviewed by Court of Appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case gained international attention
OL,7,Fafter it emerged Digwa falsely claimed
OL,8,Fhe was the victim of a racist attack,
OL,9,Fleading to Nowak being handcuffed as he
OL,10,Flay dying
OL,12,FWATCH NOW live coverage from the Court
OL,13,Fof Appeal
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
